        "description": "SKT Laboratory is a responsive WordPress theme. It is designed for research centers, testing facilities, diagnostic centers, scientific institutes, and analytical laboratories. It features a professional layout that helps showcase services, equipment, research projects, certifications, and expert teams. WooCommerce compatibility allows online bookings and service sales. SEO-friendly coding helps improve search visibility, while fast loading performance enhances user experience. SKT Laboratory is ideal for healthcare, biotechnology, and scientific organizations. Documentation : https://www.sktthemesdemo.net/documentation/skt-glass-doc/"
